 (replaces HTLC placeholder)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Sends a P2PK-locked token (NUT-11) from the trusted wallet and asserts a second
wallet cannot spend it (receive fails, balance 0) — the signature-enforcement
property behind the gonuts fork fix 296c7bf.
---
 tests/scenarios/test_wallet_sidecar.py | 38 +++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

